{
  "slug": "howtotalk",
  "name": "Howtotalk",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Meta Communication Agent — routes among 14 communication frameworks: NVC (Rosenberg), Getting to Yes (Fisher/Ury), Never Split the Difference (Voss), Radical Candor (Scott), Crucial Conversations (Patterson et al.), Difficult Conversations (Stone/Patton/Heen), Active Listening (Rogers), DESC, Influence (Cialdini), Motivational Interviewing, SCARF (Rock), Socratic Method, Storytelling frameworks. Invoke /howtotalk.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **14 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (14): `active-listening` (Active Listening (Carl Rogers + modern extensions) -- master the skill of truly hearing another person), `crucial-conversations` (Crucial Conversations (Patterson, Grenny, McMillan, Switzler) - Talk when stakes are high, opinions vary, and emotions run strong), `desc` (DESC Assertiveness Framework -- structured 4-step method for assertive communication), `difficult-conversations` (Difficult Conversations (Stone, Patton, Heen — Harvard Negotiation Project)), `getting-to-yes` (Getting to Yes (Fisher & Ury, Harvard Negotiation Project) - Principled negotiation that separates people from problems and…), `howtotalk` (Meta Communication Agent -- the router/orchestrator that selects the best communication framework(s) based on your situation), `influence` (Influence (Robert Cialdini) - The 7 principles of persuasion for ethical influence and defense against manipulation), `motivational-interviewing` (Motivational Interviewing (Miller & Rollnick) — a collaborative, person-centered approach to strengthening a person's own motivation for change), and 6 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install howtotalk@claude-community` from `ironyjk/howtotalk`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
